<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37740" root="لصب" body-key="l">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَصِبَ السَّيْفُ فِى الغِمْدِ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَصَبَ</span></b> , (inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَصْبٌ</span>,
as in a copy of the S, perhaps a mistake for
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَصَبٌ</span>,) <i>The sword stuck in the scabbard,</i> (S, K,)
<i>and would not come forth.</i> (S.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسِبَ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزَبَ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَصِبَ الجِلْدُ بِاللَّحْمِ</span> (K) or simply
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لصب الجلد</span>, (S,) <i>The skin stuck to the flesh, by
reason of emaciation.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَصِبَ الخَاتَمُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى الإِصْبَعِ</span> <i>The ring stuck fast upon the finger:</i>
contr. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلِقَ</span>. (S, K.)

